    "body": "General advice: Use tequila with psi4 in separate environments.\r\nTry to create a new env like:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nconda create -n tq-psi4 python=3.9\r\nconda activate tq-psi4\r\nconda install psi4 -c psi4\r\npip install tequila-basic\r\npip install qulacs\r\n```\r\n\r\nworked in this case.\r\n",
